  "title": {
    "zh": "候补席的仪表读数",
    "en": "Readings on the Reserve List"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "首轮检修只覆盖前 3 天。凡读数至少 20°C 的已清洗记录，按温度从高到低排队，同温由较小编号优先。第一名直接送检。交出第二到第四名的读数和它们的平均温度。",
    "en": "The first inspection covers days 1 through 3. Rank cleaned readings of at least 20°C, hottest first, with lower IDs winning ties. The first reading goes straight to inspection. Deliver the readings ranked second through fourth and their mean."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "SQL 并列排序、数组切片与均值",
    "en": "SQL tie ordering, array slicing and mean"
  },
